@SportMatch_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Login (send first)
# @name login
POST {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "karolis123", "password": "test1234" }

### Recommended games near Vilnius center (best score first, with distance)
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/recommended?lat=54.6872&lng=25.2797
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Recommended games without location (distance is left out of the score)
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json

### TEST: only lat given (expect 400)
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/recommended?lat=54.6872
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### TEST: location out of range (expect 400)
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/recommended?lat=100&lng=25.2797
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### TEST: without token (expect 401)
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/recommended?lat=54.6872&lng=25.2797
